    <string name="howto_title">How to connect</string>
    <string name="howto_message">1. USB cable (easiest)\nEnable USB debugging on the target, plug it in with an OTG cable, then tap Start.\n\n2. USB → Wi-Fi\nPlug in once, tap “USB → Wi-Fi”, unplug. The target stays reachable on port 5555 until it reboots.\n\n3. Wireless debugging (Android 11+, no cable)\nOn the target: Developer options → Wireless debugging → “Pair device with pairing code”. Here: tap “Pair (Android 11+)” or “Find devices”.\n\nBoth phones must be on the same Wi-Fi network (or one on the other\'s hotspot).</string>

